---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import ServiceList from '../components/ServiceList.astro';
import PageNavigationGrid from '../components/PageNavigationGrid.astro';

---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Services | Helix Equine Vets"
  description="Explore the range of equine veterinary services offered by Helix Equine Vets, including routine care, emergency treatment, diagnostics, and more."
>

<ServiceList />

<section class="prose-navy-wrapper">
  <div class="prose-container">
    <h2>Our Approach to Equine Veterinary Care</h2>
      <h3>Continuity You Can Rely On</h3>
      <p>We know how much it matters to deal with a vet who already understands your horse and your yard. Wherever possible, your horse will be seen by the same experienced clinician, and every case is managed with full visibility of the history and previous treatment — so you're never starting from scratch.</p>
      <h3>Serious Investment in Portable Diagnostics</h3>
      <p>We've invested heavily in portable digital radiography, ultrasonography and endoscopy from day one — bringing referral-quality diagnostics directly to your yard. Investigations that once meant a stressful trip to hospital can now be carried out stable side.</p>
      <h3>Local Knowledge</h3>
      <p>Ten-plus years working exclusively across Northumberland and Tyne and Wear means a real understanding of the local equestrian community — racing, competition, breeding and leisure.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<PageNavigationGrid />

</BaseLayout>
